<title>GABON: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>GABON GOVERNMENT LIST (961130)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 30 Nov 96 - General elections due to be held on December 1*</p>
<p> *		 were postponed indefinitely.			*</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> President..........................................Omar BONGO</p>
<p>(Sworn in 22 Jan 94 for a fifth five-year term)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Formed 30 Oct 94)</p>
<p> Prime Minister............................Paulin OBAME-NGUEMA</p>
<p>(Appointed 12 Oct 94, Sworn in 2 Nov 94)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
